## Layers & components

<!-- tasks.md is broken down from this table. Mark anything not built as "chưa tạo" / "cần sửa". -->

Paths are relative to `app/src/main/java/com/example/innerlamp/`.

| Layer | File | Responsibility | Trạng thái |
|---|---|---|---|
| UI / Screen | `ui/screens/{{feature}}/{{Feature}}Screen.kt` | Composable, `modifier: Modifier = Modifier`, preview in `InnerLampTheme` | <!-- có / chưa tạo --> |
| UI / State | `ui/screens/{{feature}}/{{Feature}}UiState.kt` | UI-only state (loading, field errors, display values) | |
| UI / ViewModel | `ui/screens/{{feature}}/{{Feature}}ViewModel.kt` | Calls use cases, exposes `StateFlow<UiState>` | |
| UI / Navigation | `ui/navigation/Routes.kt`, `AppNavHost.kt` | `@Serializable` route + destination wiring | |
| Domain / Model | `domain/model/<!-- X -->.kt` | Pure Kotlin business fields | |
| Domain / UseCase | `domain/usecase/<!-- Verb -->{{Feature}}UseCase.kt` | `operator fun invoke` → `Result`/`Flow`; dispatcher via `DispatcherProvider` | |
| Domain / Repository | `domain/repository/{{Feature}}Repository.kt` | Interface owned by domain | |
| Data / Remote | `data/remote/api/{{Feature}}ApiService.kt`, `data/remote/dto/` | Retrofit service + `@Serializable` DTOs (only once the contract is confirmed) | |
| Data / Mapper | `data/mapper/{{Feature}}Mapper.kt` | DTO/entity ↔ domain | |
| Data / Local | `core/database/…` / `core/storage/…` | Room entity/DAO, prefs or secure storage — delete row if none | |
| Data / Repository | `data/repository/{{Feature}}RepositoryImpl.kt` | Implements the interface via `safeCall`; maps `NetworkResult` → `Result` | |
| DI | `di/{{Feature}}Module.kt` | Manual wiring (no Hilt/Koin) | |
| Tests | `app/src/test/java/com/example/innerlamp/…` | ViewModel, use case, repository, vectors | |

